    "custom_liquid_kYeXpn": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "<div class=\"cp-sec\">\n  <h2 class=\"cp-title\">Comment le porter</h2>\n  <div class=\"cp-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cp-col\">\n      <div class=\"cp-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1035/0870/5615/files/ChatGPT_Image_19_aout_2026_22_10_56.png?v=1787612323\" alt=\"Insérer\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cp-step\">\n        <span class=\"cp-num\"><svg class=\"cp-fruit\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#F6C6A0\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"16.5\" fill=\"#FBEFE6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#E97768\"/><g stroke=\"#FBEFE6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"34\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"30\"/></g></svg><span class=\"cp-n\">1</span></span>\n        <h3 class=\"cp-h\">Insérer</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"cp-desc\">Placez votre Booby Trap à l'intérieur de votre soutien-gorge de sport, la partie la plus large en bas, là où la transpiration s'accumule habituellement.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cp-col\">\n      <div class=\"cp-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1035/0870/5615/files/ChatGPT_Image_19_aout_2026_22_15_22.png?v=1787612323\" alt=\"Portez et partez\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cp-step\">\n        <span class=\"cp-num\"><svg class=\"cp-fruit\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#F6C6A0\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"16.5\" fill=\"#FBEFE6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#E97768\"/><g stroke=\"#FBEFE6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"34\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"30\"/></g></svg><span class=\"cp-n\">2</span></span>\n        <h3 class=\"cp-h\">Portez et partez</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"cp-desc\">Faites du sport, allaitez, surmontez une bouffée de chaleur… et tout le reste. Votre Booby Trap est conçu pour vous accompagner dans tous vos mouvements.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cp-col\">\n      <div class=\"cp-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1035/0870/5615/files/ChatGPT_Image_19_aout_2026_22_29_38.png?v=1787612323\" alt=\"Laver et réutiliser\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cp-step\">\n        <span class=\"cp-num\"><svg class=\"cp-fruit\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#F6C6A0\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"16.5\" fill=\"#FBEFE6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#E97768\"/><g stroke=\"#FBEFE6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"34\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"30\"/></g></svg><span class=\"cp-n\">3</span></span>\n        <h3 class=\"cp-h\">Laver et réutiliser</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"cp-desc\">Après utilisation, lavez en machine à l'eau froide (de préférence dans un sac de lavage Booby Trap), puis réutilisez pour profiter d'une sensation de sécheresse accrue.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,700;9..144,900&display=swap');\n  .cp-sec{--rose:#FAEEE6;--pample:#E97768;--ink:#1A1A1A;width:100vw;max-width:100vw;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);background:var(--rose);padding:64px 20px;text-align:center;}\n  .cp-title{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(28px,4.4vw,44px);color:var(--pample);margin:0 0 40px;}\n  .cp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;}\n  .cp-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}\n  .cp-imgwrap{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:20px;background:#fff;}\n  .cp-imgwrap img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;display:block;}\n  .cp-step{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}\n  .cp-num{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;width:46px;height:46px;}\n  .cp-fruit{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;}\n  .cp-n{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:#1A1A1A;}\n  .cp-h{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:900;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);margin:0;}\n  .cp-desc{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;max-width:340px;margin:0;}\n  @media(max-width:760px){\n    .cp-sec{padding:48px 0;}\n    .cp-title{padding:0 16px;margin-bottom:30px;}\n    .cp-grid{display:flex;grid-template-columns:none;max-width:none;gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding:0 16px;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}\n    .cp-grid::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n    .cp-col{flex:0 0 82%;scroll-snap-align:center;}\n    .cp-desc{max-width:none;}\n  }\n</style>",
